      // a <title> and nothing else, so sharing its link on WhatsApp, iMessage or
      // Slack showed a bare URL — and for a small business that link IS the
      // marketing.
      // ── FROM THE BRIEF, AND THE BAKED EXAMPLE IS GONE (2026-08-27, owner's
